        "original_id": "364e1ba2-b517-575f-89d5-a70da4db942e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Pirner, Les McKeown, Butch Vig\n- Bands: Soul Asylum, Bay City Rollers\n- Songs: \"Just Like Anyone\"\n\nFacts:\n- Leslie Richard McKeown was born on 12 November 1955 and is a Scottish pop singer.\n- Les McKeown was the lead singer of the Bay City Rollers during the band's most successful period.\n- David Anthony \"Dave\" Pirner was born on April 16, 1964 and is an American songwriter, singer, and producer.\n- Dave Pirner is best known as the lead vocalist and frontman for the alternative rock band Soul Asylum.\n- Dave Pirner wrote the song \"Just Like Anyone.\"\n- Soul Asylum and Butch Vig produced the song \"Just Like Anyone.\"\n- \"Just Like Anyone\" was released as the second single from its album.",
